window.products.push({"id":447170,"name":"Scott Living Santiago Coastal Reversible Cotton Queen Comforter Set - 3 Piece | 1 Comforter - 2 Shams | Modern Designer Luxury Bedding | Soft Durable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1nCEQyKgPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After renovating houses for hundreds of families, hosts of HGTV’s “Property Brothers” Drew and Jonathan Scott know how to make a home work for everyone – and that includes high-quality home furnishings, textiles and décor that look great and fit your needs. Scott Living by Drew & Jonathan reflects their commitment to help you create the perfect space for the people you love. With the Scott Brothers’ latest collection featuring modern and nature-inspired patterns, you’re sure to make a statement. A DESIGNER LOOK TO LOVE in a reversible 100% cotton comforter set. Two watercolor blue prints are featured in this coastal comforter set. Face fabric features a smooth, sateen weave with light sheen, adding an element of luxury while reversing to a breathable, cool-crisp cotton percale for durability that gets softer over time. Queen set Includes: 1 Queen Comforter (90in x 92in), 2 Standard Shams (20in x 26in). King Set Includes: 1 King Comforter (104in x 92in), 2 King Shams (20in x 36in). MUST HAVE FEATURES Our contemporary comforter and pillow shams are constructed with a knife edge finish for a true tailored look. Every inch features a soft and dreamy 8-ounce polyester fill that adds the right amount of warmth and breathability for a luxurious blissful sleep. Each sham includes a center opening with a five-inch overlap to secure the pillow. These clean corners, lightweight fill, and quality materials make this a perfect luxury designer comforter set. CAREFULLY DESIGNED, Scott Living bedding is better for you, your family, and the planet. Our products are Oeko-Tex Made in Green Certified. They have met high environmental and safety standards including tested for harmful substances. Our sustainable processes are manufactured under environmentally friendly, socially responsible working conditions. Our cotton comforter is environmentally friendly as cotton is naturally biodegradable unlike a microfiber that is difficult to break down. EASY CARE, Machine wash warm with like colors, normal cycle. Use large capacity washer and dryer. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low, remove promptly. Do not iron. Do not dry clean. We stand by our product and offer a 30-DAY \"LOVE-IT\" GUARANTEE, \"We're not happy unless you're happy\".  We recommend for an added polished look, pair or gift with the Baristo Quilt Set and the Cody HygroCotton Sateen 400 Thread-Count Performance Sheet Set, both by Scott Living. Each sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1nCEQyKgPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scott Living","source_asin":"B09LVNN68S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-447170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LVNN68S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LVNN68S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
