window.products.push({"id":447176,"name":"Luxury Large Turkish Style Beach Towel 36\" x 70\" Sand Free Flat Woven in Front and Absorbent Terry on Reverse. (Grey/Blue, Single 36\" x 70\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yQZhuWhVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Premium Absorbent Soft Cotton ⭐ OVERSIZED & COMFORTABLE- Luxuriously Extra large 36\"x 70\" (90 x 177cm) providing perfect coverage and noticeable absorbency on both sides. While the flat woven surface effectively prevent sand to stick everywhere, the reverse provides soft feel when you when you lie on it. ⭐ SOPHISTICATION - Designed for Elegance, Durability, and Beauty. Combined with fancy fringes and unique selection of colors, the Nostalgic Collection features a flat woven side and a soft terry cotton in the reverse. The flat woven classic stripes are made from an unique knitting technique inspired the same way they were manufactured centuries ago in Mediterranean. ⭐ PREMIUM QUALITY - Heavyweight 420 GSM 1.6lbs 100% Superior Cotton. Created for Premium buyers, this Classic Turkish Style towel has the Yarn dyed in the front before woven using Peshtemal construction, which guarantees greater durability and liveliness of the color. The Reverse is a plush white terry loop cotton for superior absorbency. 🌎 OEKO-TEX CERTIFIED: 36\" x 70\" ( 90 x 177cm ) and weighs 1.6lbs lbs per pc. To attain the international Oeko-Tex Standard 100 certification, the fabric has been tested and certified to be free from harmful levels of more than 100 substances known to be harmful to human health. It also means that the production cares about the environment being ecologic safe. ⭐ MACHINE WASHABLE: For best results, wash separately the first time. The towel gets softer and more absorbent with every wash. DO NOT use bleach, fabric softeners, and iron. Wash with cold water and tumble dry on low heat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yQZhuWhVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Softerry","source_asin":"B07S3TCC87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-447176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S3TCC87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S3TCC87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
