window.products.push({"id":447205,"name":"Allydrew 14\" Set of 3 Tissue Pom Poms Party Decorations for Weddings, Birthday Parties Baby Showers and Nursery Décor, Aqua","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VQsP8qPFL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Decorate you event with these fun and colorful tissue pom poms. They can be used for weddings, birthday parties, bridal and baby showers, and or any special event you have in mind. The pom poms are easy to assemble, simply unfold the tissue paper with the edges to the outside and carefully pull the strips of tissue paper away one by one. Gently store them away when not in use and use them again and again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VQsP8qPFL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"allydrew","source_asin":"B00LFT82MS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-447205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LFT82MS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LFT82MS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":447206,"name":"artgeist Canvas Wall Art Print World Map 80x40 in - 5pcs Home Decor Framed Stretched Picture Photo Painting Artwork Image Map of The World k-A-0431-b-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+REJvaqbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CANVAS PICTURES Printed pictures are trending lately when it comes to interior designing – they serve as an alternative to classic paintings.High quality materials and large-format printers give us the opportunity to recreate even the tiniest details of the copied photography. Pictures are also UV-resistant and this is why colors are sharper than ever. Every picture is stretched over a wooden frame – you don’t need to worry about any additional utilities in order to put it on the wall. To make sure that the painting will look great on your wall, we mount the canvas onto a matched stretcher bar made of Natureeeal, solid wood (1,5 cm thick).We offer a whole variety of different themed pictures, that will give you the possibility to make your surroundings lovelier and hopefully unlock your inner creativity. The highest possible quality and modern approach will surely meet your expectations as a client.Also, keep in mind - we do not offer stocked items - every order is being produced individually after the purchase. Products are made exclusively in our own manufacturing facilities – hence, we offer the best quality vs. price ratio. IMPORTANT In case the picture consists of more than one piece, please remember to keep a certain distance between them (compare it with the picture displayed online).Please keep in mind that because of the screen settings, actual colours may vary from the ones visible on the picture online. Pictures are only displayed for illustration purposes. They serve as an exemplar of how the canvas print might look like in a particular surrounding. Please measure your wall properly and make sure you pick the right size.It's possible only to send 3 products in one package, so if you want to order more products, please submit an appropriate number of individual orders.All our products belong to the Artgeist.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+REJvaqbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"artgeist","source_asin":"B07MW55K9J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-447206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MW55K9J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MW55K9J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
