window.products.push({"id":447329,"name":"Saturnpower Bread Maker Machine, Rapid Bake Breadmaker 12 Settings Automatic Digital Bread Machine for Home, Nonstick Pan, 2 Loaf Sizes 3 Crust Colors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PInP+UU8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you still buying bread every day? It's time to experience the fun of making your own bread, which is not only more delicious but also more economical. This bread machine is simple to operate, saves time and effort, and can make a variety of breads. The maximum capacity of 2 pounds can fully meet the needs of the family. Even beginners can bake a large loaf of bread, and it is healthier and cheaper than buying bread from the store. Come and enjoy delicious bread with your family Feature: - 12 Digital Programs: Basic, French, Whole Wheat, Quick, Sweet, Gluten Free, Rapid Bake, Dough, Jam, Cake, Sandwich, Bake - 3 Crust Options: light, medium or dark. Enjoy 3 different bread flavors - 2 Bread Sizes: 1.5 lbs or 2 lbs - Top Viewing Window:You can check the baking progress of bread at any time from the top window - 60 minutes warm-keeping and 13 hours programmable delay timer function - Power Off Memory Function: if the power supply is interrupted in the process of making bread, as long as the power is turned off within 10 minutes, the bread will have memory function and continue to work Specifications: - Color: White - Material: PP, aluminum, stainless steel - Net weight: 5,95 pounds - Product size: 12.48\"Lx10.91\"Wx12.6\"H - Product packaging size: 15.16\"Lx12\"Wx13.19\"H - Length of Power Cord:38.31inch - Output Power:550W - Capacity: 2L (Max) Simple bread making steps: Just add the ingredients you like, select the menu/color/size, start the cycle, and then the bread machine will bake, you just need to wait patiently for the freshly baked bread Attention: - Before first use, operate the bread maker on the BAKE (#12) program and bake empty for 10 minutes, and then use it after cooling - Please make sure the inner pot is placed correctly before making - When choosing Color and LOAF, you need to choose accordi","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PInP+UU8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saturnpower","source_asin":"B091C1YMR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-447329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091C1YMR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091C1YMR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
