window.products.push({"id":447335,"name":"King Softside Waterbed with Euro Top Water Bed Mattress","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2591.71,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LLC+3YUiS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"King Size 5000 Euro Top 76\"Wide x 80 Long Look at the materials used to make this luxurious mattress. * The outer material of the mattress is a Premium Bamboo outer material. Durable yet soft and breathable in a white color with - 2\" Visco Comfort Layer- Super soft Visco perfect combination inside the Euro top The above combination of materials makes this plush cover-super soft and more importantly very breathable. The foundation is strong and is is covered in fabric. 9 Leg bed frame holds up the whole bed and it can be attatched to most headboards just like a regular bed frame. The Inside of the Euro Top Mattress has a high density foam edge support which supports the weight of the water on all sides. 7\" deep fill. The foam edges are connected to the opposite side for better support and to prevent dips and sagging.Fitted Safety Liner is included *Choice of 4 Deep-fill systems *Full Motion Support is available which has allot of movement; Very similer to the original waterbeds.*90% waveless Lumabr 6-7 seconds of movement * 95% Waveless w/ contour back support and 3-4 seconds of slow movement. * 99%% Waveless w/ contour back support which has 1-2 second of very slow movement and better support. All four Supports are made of virgin vinyl with reinforced corners. Also the motionless supports have fiber inside. The fiber is all connected together to help prevent shifting and sliding. \"Let us know which support you want with your new bed Full Motion, 90% 95% or 100% motionless\" We also carry dual bladders and dual heater for $169 any questions just contact us. The heating system will control the temperature of the mattress. In the winter this feature makes the bed even more comfortable. We always strive to have the highest quality available. *This is a complete bed which includes complete Mattress, Box & Frame. Thank-you for looking at our Mattress Cover Amazon Store","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LLC+3YUiS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U.S. Water, Calesco, Aqua Fusion, Mattress Covers","source_asin":"B00523IWZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-447335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00523IWZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00523IWZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
