window.products.push({"id":447417,"name":"Mencapai Portable Air Cooler Fan, 4 in 1 Personal Evaporative Air Conditioner with 1400ML Water Tank, Remote Controller, Timer, 3 Wind Speeds, 2 Misti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AgtkhiPVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💦【Energy Saving & Quiet】: This small portable air conditioner for room consumes only 7W (it is recommended to use a 5V 1.5A and above adapter. ), saving electricity and money. With unique air duct design and fluid mechanics, this air conditioner operates with low noise and will not disturb your life, work and sleep. We will give you 6 months warranty. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. 💦【4 in 1 MultiFunction Fan】: This mini air conditioner portable adopts dual ultrasonic atomizers and wet curtain triple cooling, the cooling effect is more obvious. It combines mini air conditioner, fan, humidifier and LED night light 4 functions into one. All you have to do is pour water into the tank and it will quickly reduce the ambient temperature, providing you with cool, fresh, comfortable air. The compact portable design is perfect for home, kitchen, bedroom, dorm, desk, office. 💦【2 Wind Modes & 3 Speed Levels】: Evaporative air cooler portable have two modes: natural wind and cool wind. Natural wind has 3 different speed levels (low/medium/high). There are 3 spray levels for cold air: continuous spray/intermittent spray (10 seconds on and 5 seconds off)/natural wind. The air cooler has its own up and down adjustable wind direction window, which is convenient and comfortable to use. Come and customize your own personal cooling zone to suit your needs! 💦【Large Capacity Water Tank & Leak-Proof Design】: The top of the portable air cooler fan is designed with a fully enclosed 1400ml water tank, with a visible water window, which can run for 8 hours when full of water, avoiding frequent opening of the lid to check the water level. The bottom leak-proof storage tank is designed to collect condensate water. The air outlet is fully atomized, and it is not easy to get wet for a long time. So you don't have to worry about water getting your desk wet. 💦【Remote Control & 7 Color Lights】: Portable ac air conditioner for room can be operated through the control panel and the remote control. The remote control can operate at a distance of about 16.4 FT (5M), which is more convenient to use. Built in 7 color ights create a romantic atmosphere for you, which can be turned off at any time. When you fall asleep or forget to turn off, you can set a timer (1h/2h/4h) to automatically turn off to avoid headaches and colds caused by long-term cold wind. 💦【USB Charging & Portable】: The product does not contain a battery, needs to be connected to a power source for use. It can be powered by USB adapters, laptops, computers, power banks. (Only Type-C data cable is provided, adapter is not included). The small room air conditioner is 7.5*6.8*11.5 inches 1.9 lbs, equipped with carrying handle, easy to carry and move from one room to another. Perfect for home, kitchen, office, bedroom, travel, outdoor sports, cool summer with family and friends! 💦【Built-in Water Shortage Automatic Protection】: Long Press the \"Wind\" button for 3s to turn on, the indicator light will change from red to blue. When turned on, room air conditioner defaults to natural wind/low wind speed/spray/LED light discoloration; when there is water shortage, the machine will automatically start the protection, the spray indicator will flash 5 times quickly, and then change to natural wind/low wind speed/no spray. That way you don't have to worry when you fall asleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AgtkhiPVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mencapai","source_asin":"B0B5QZST3P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-447417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5QZST3P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5QZST3P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
