window.products.push({"id":447435,"name":"LED Light Up Balloons, Transparent Reusable Double Layer Balloon Inside a Balloon with Support Cup and Stick, Perfect for Birthday,Wedding, Holiday, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v+4kRw52L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: Each balloon set come with double layered balloons, supporting cup and Holding stick with colorful light string that can be tight around the balloons and around the handle in multiple combinations to enhance any atmosphere. Specification: Outer Clear Balloon size: 8'' x 8'' The Largest Blowing Size: 18 ~ 20 inches Inner Foil Balloon size: 7” x 6”  Light string length: 118 inches Light color: Multi-color  Power Supply: 2 AA batteries(not included) Handling Tips: For proper inflated size, please make sure to gently stretch each balloon in all directions before inflating. Balloon must be inflate by pressurized Inflating equipment, please do not inflate the balloons with your mouth or else it'll not reach the full maximum size. Do not over inflate or risk the danger of bursting. Please inflate the outer latex balloons first then the inner foil Balloon, alternate inflation till both reaches the desired size After inflating the balloon, please secure and tightens the opening to prevent leaking. Once balloon opening is securely fasten, place the balloon on top of the holder cup and the support stick and wrap the balloon with flashing string lights and use the battery pack to turn the light on/off Please note: Please do not leave children unattended with the balloons. Do not use the Balloons in restricted area such as Air field etc. Please do not inflate the balloons with hydrogen, keep the balloons away from Fire, lighter, stove, smoking and highly populated areas. Wire / Battery box is not waterproof, please keep it away from water.. Please allow 1-2cm error due to manual measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v+4kRw52L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Capital Wireless","source_asin":"B079RCCSCZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-447435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079RCCSCZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079RCCSCZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
