window.products.push({"id":447834,"name":"INSE Cordless Vacuum Cleaner with Powerful Suction, Rechargeable Vacuum with 2200m-Ah Battery Up to 45 Minutes Runtime, 6 in 1 Lightweight Handheld Va","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516La7V3TCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This cordless stick handheld vacuum cleaner adopts a 160W powerful brushless motor to ensure strong suction up to 12KPa is great for families with pets since it generates outstanding and surprising suction on Max Mode, which makes capturing pet hair, cat litter, food, and other messes much easier than ever before. In addition to hard floors and carpets, cordless vacuums can be used to clean stairs, windowsills, sofas, beds, desks, and curtains. The battery-powered vacuum has 2-speed modes(Standard Mode: 45 mins; MAX Mode: 15 mins). Detachable and chargeable high-performance battery delivers up to 45 minutes of uninterrupted long runtime which is ideal for full house cleaning. Also, the battery handle can be removed from the cordless stick vacuum and charged independently. A spare battery is available in our store for longer runtime and as backup use. The upgraded motorized floor brush enables the 6-in-1 stick vacuum to work wonderfully both on carpets and hardwood floors. With its motorized LED brush which can maneuverable 150° swivels sideways and 90°up and down, the cordless vacuum effectively removes embedded dirt under furniture, protects floors from scratches, and cleans both hard floors and carpets thoroughly. Besides the upgraded roller with stiff bristles can easily pat and pick up dust and debris deep hidden in the carpets. The lightweight cordless vacuum weighs only 3.3lbs, adapts to different cleaning situations from floor to ceiling, and can be easily used with the detachable extendable metal tube to convert from a stick vac to a handheld vacuum to clean ceiling and high surface corner debris. What's more, its ultra-quiet operation sound avoids annoying noise, very friendly to your baby and pet. With a complete sealing design and a high-density HEPA filter, our cordless vacuum captures 99.99% of microscopic dust and isolates fine dust, dirt debris, sawdust, ashes, chips, and powders while releasing purified fresher air effectively preventing secondary pollution. To maintain the performance and life of your vacuum, we recommend replacing the filter regularly. We offer a 12-month warranty, accessory replacement, and 7/24 after-sale service to ensure that our customers enjoy a premium purchasing experience. Please let us know if you have any questions or concerns about our product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516La7V3TCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0BJF5GPWK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-447834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJF5GPWK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJF5GPWK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
