window.products.push({"id":447919,"name":"Purist Aromas Loose Incense: Certified Organic and All Natural Botanicals, Sandalwood with a hint of Cinnamon-Vanilla Cinnamon Seduction Mix.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HY0QuF2QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Directions: Line your tealight candle warmer with aluminum foil, add 1/2 tsp (+ or -) of incense and a small amount of water to your warmer. Light the tealight candle and wait for the wonderful aromas to fill the room. To make the scents last longer check your candle warmer every so often and add small amounts of water as it evaporates. Please compost herbs and recycle aluminum foil when done. When any kind of incense is burned, it releases smoke full of carcinogens into your home. The only way to avoid this is to heat incense without actually burning it. I've found the best way to do this is to use an oil/wax warmer heated by a candle underneath. (The electric candle warmers don't seem to get hot enough to melt the resins that are found in most loose incense.) I have also found that adding water to the incense, while you're heating it in the wax warmer, helps distribute the scent farther and more evenly in the house. If you don't want sticky resin in your wax warmer put a piece of aluminum foil in the dish before you heat the incense. Disclaimer: I have not burned any of these on an incense charcoal and have no idea what they smell like burnt, burn at your own risk. WARNING: All herbs we sell are for aromatherapy purposes only. Do not ingest in any form. We do not sell anything for medicinal purposes. The FDA has not evaluated any statements on this product. No claims are made as to any medicinal value of these products and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any diseases.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HY0QuF2QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Purist Aromas","source_asin":"B00EIREWGO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-447919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EIREWGO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EIREWGO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
